        {
          "text": "abo bose bafatanya na bagenzi babo b’ abakuru, bararahira barīsiba ko bazohora bagendera mu vyagezwe vy’Imana vyatanzwe na Mose umusavyi wayo, kandi ko bazokwitondera amabgirizwa yose y’Uhoraho Umwami wacu, bakayashitsa, bo n’ivyo yihanikirije n’ivyo yashinze. ",
