          "text": "kandi tuzozana abahungu bacu b’imfura n’ uburiza bg’ivyo dutunze, ubg’ inka zacu n’ubg’ intama zacu, tubizane mu ngoro y’Imana yacu nk’uko vyanditswe mu vyagezwe, tubishikirize abaherezi bakora mu ngoro y’Imana yacu. ",
