        },
        {
          "text": "Tuzohora tuzana ifu yacu y’umushuzo isewe iheretuwe, n’amashikanwa yacu azunguzwa, n’umushuzo w’ ivyama ku biti vy’ubgoko bgose, n’uwa vino n’amavuta, tubishikirize abaherezi, babishingure mu vyumba vyo ku ngoro y’Imana yacu; n’Abalewi tuzobashikiriza ikigiracumi c’ivyeze vyo mu mirima yacu, kukw Abalewi ari bo bākīra ibigiracumi mu bisagara vyacu vyose aho dufise imirima. ",
