          "text": "Kand’ umuherezi wo mu ba Aroni azohora ajana n’Abalewi bagiye kwākīra ibigiracumi vyabo; Abalewi na bo bazokūramw’ ikigiracumi co mur’ ivyo bigiracumi nyene, babizane mu ngoro y’ Imana yacu, babishingure mu vyumba vy’ububīko. ",
